我觉得，我真的很喜欢我们剧里的这个细节。

183
00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:45.140
I do too.
我也是。

184
00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:52.940
And Rain in the DVD commentary said he noticed a difference in how the ladies acted around him this week in this uniform.
雷恩在DVD评论音轨里说，他注意到这周女士们在他穿上这身制服后的态度有所不同。

185
00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:56.660
He said all the ladies acted a little differently.
他说所有的女士表现得都有点不一样。

186
00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:57.300
Huh.
呵。

187
00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:01.300
Well, we'll have to get him in here to give us more details on that.
好吧，我们得把他叫来，让他给我们讲讲更多细节。

188
00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:02.460
All right.
好的。

189
00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:05.360
So, fast fact number three is not about this episode.
那么，快问快答第三条和这集无关。

190
00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:06.100
Oh.
哦。

191
00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:07.740
It's not about Game of Thrones either.
也和《权力的游戏》无关。

192
00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:08.900
I just want to say that.
我只是想说一下。

193
00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:09.240
Okay.
好吧。

194
00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:12.160
This is inspired by some fan mail that we got.
这是受我们收到的一些粉丝来信的启发。

195
00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:17.040
It made me want to speak about the Michael Scotts of the world.
这让我想要谈谈世界上那些“迈克尔·斯科特”们。

196
00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:20.140
I have no idea where you're going.
我完全不知道你要说什么。

197
00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:20.500
Okay.
好吧。

198
00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:21.520
I'm here for it.
我洗耳恭听。

199
00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:24.040
Well, I got this letter.
嗯，我收到了这封信。

200
00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:25.940
I jinxed M33.
我中了M33的咒语。

201
00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:26.700
Okay.
好的。

202
00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:27.680
Wrote in to say,
有人写信来说，

203
00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:32.980
trivia, there was a character on Young and the Restless named Michael Scott.
冷知识，在《年轻和躁动不安的一族》里有个角色叫迈克尔·斯科特。

204
00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:37.000
He was locked in the basement by Victor Newman.
他被维克多·纽曼关在了地下室里。

205
00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.000
Oh, Victor Newman was so evil.
噢，维克多·纽曼真是太坏了。

206
00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:40.800
So, I looked it up.
于是，我查了一下。

207
00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:45.980
And yes, from 1981 to 82, there was this character named Michael Scott.
没错，从1981年到1982年，确实有个角色叫迈克尔·斯科特。

208
00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:48.260
He was played by actor Nicholas Benedict.
他由演员尼古拉斯·本尼迪克特饰演。

209
00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:55.420
So, Michael Scott was a photographer and he had an affair with Victor's first wife, Julia.
迈克尔·斯科特是个摄影师，他和维克多的第一任妻子朱莉娅有染。

210
00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:57.900
And so, Victor locked him in a basement?
所以，维克多把他关在地下室里了？

211
00:09:58.100 --> 00:09:58.280
Yeah.
是的。

212
00:09:58.600 --> 00:10:02.800
He locked him in his bomb shelter, which was in the basement?
他把他关在地下室里的防空洞里了？

213
00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.700
Victor was a very wealthy man.
维克多是个非常有钱的人。

214
00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:06.720
He probably had a whole bunker.
他可能有个完整的地堡。

215
00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:08.260
Well, listen to what he did, though.
不过，你听听他做了什么。

216
00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.180
Why do I know all this about Young and the Restless?
为什么我对《年轻和躁动不安的一族》这么了解？

217
00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:10.600
Okay, go.
好吧，继续。

218
00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:11.220
Did you watch it?
你看过吗？

219
00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:14.340
My grandmother did her stories, but she wouldn't admit to it.
我祖母会看她的肥皂剧，但她不肯承认。

220
00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:14.920
Oh, that's right.
噢，没错。

221
00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:17.640
She'd say, I don't even care anything about that.
她会说，我才不在乎那些呢。

222
00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:19.120
But she'd leave it on all day.
但她会把电视开着一整天。

223
00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:21.480
And her stories would be playing in the background.
她的肥皂剧就在背景里播放着。

224
00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:23.560
So, I watched all my children.
我以前看《我的孩子们》。

225
00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:27.380
My mom watched all my children when she nursed me.
我妈在我吃奶的时候看《我的孩子们》。

226
00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:34.360
And then she said that's how she got into it, was that it was on when it was time to nurse me as a baby.
她说她就是这么入坑的，因为那是她喂我吃奶时电视里播的节目。

227
00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:35.860
And then she watched it.
然后她就看上瘾了。

228
00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:38.220
I kind of grew up watching it with her, right?
我算是跟着她一起长大的，对吧？

229
00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:46.960
And then when I went to college, I arranged my class schedule so that I could be home to watch all my children.
后来我上大学时，我特意安排了课程表，好让我能赶回家看《我的孩子们》。

230
00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:49.020
Because it was on at noon.
因为它是在中午播的。

231
00:10:49.020 --> 00:10:50.000
It was on ABC.
在ABC频道播的。

232
00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:52.220
Kelly Ripa was on it, by the way.
顺便说一下，凯莉·里帕也演过那个。

233
00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:52.660
Oh, yeah.
噢，是啊。

234
00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:56.040
And, you know, we didn't have what we have now.
而且，你知道，那时候我们没有现在这些东西。

235
00:10:56.160 --> 00:10:58.420
We didn't have this, like, digital recording stuff.
我们没有那种数字录制设备。

236
00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:00.360
If you missed it, you missed it.
错过了就真的错过了。

237
00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:00.780
You missed it.
你错过了就没了。

238
00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:04.500
Well, listen to what Victor Newman did to poor Michael Scott in the basement.
好了，听听维克多·纽曼在地下室里对可怜的迈克尔·斯科特做了什么。

239
00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:05.520
Oh, no, Victor.
噢，不，维克多。

240
00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:08.000
He fed him baked rats.
他喂他吃烤老鼠。

241
00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:09.460
Ew, Victor.
咦，维克多。

242
00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:10.440
Yeah.
是啊。

243
00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:17.400
He also put in, like, a live video feed so that Michael Scott had to watch Victor make love to Julia.
他还装了实时视频监控，让迈克尔·斯科特被迫看着维克多和朱莉娅亲热。

244
00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:20.200
Wow, that is twisted.
哇，那真是变态。

245
00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:20.840
Yeah.
是啊。

246
00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:23.620
I want to be in the writer's room at Young and the Restless.
我想去《年轻和躁动不安的一族》的编剧室看看。

247
00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:27.160
I want to see what's on their cards on the wall.
我想看看他们墙上的卡片都写了些什么。

248
00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:28.100
Yeah.
是啊。

249
00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:30.400
Michael Scott in basement.
迈克尔·斯科特在地下室。

250
00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:35.020
Well, eventually Julia discovered what was going on.
嗯，最终朱莉娅发现了这一切。

251
00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:36.000
And she freed him.
她放了他。

252
00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:37.080
Good.
很好。

253
00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:37.540
Yeah.
是啊。

254
00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:39.700
So he's not—he made it out alive.
所以他没……他活着出来了。

255
00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.320
But he was there for years?
但他被关了几年？

256
00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:42.220
Yeah.
是啊。

257
00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:42.920
Wow.
哇。

258
00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:43.560
Okay.
好吧。

259
00:11:43.740 --> 00:11:46.580
So, next, Michael Scott.
那么，接下来，迈克尔·斯科特。

260
00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:51.540
Remember that bobblehead that was in the vending machine at the beginning of Boo's Cruise?
还记得《布的游轮》开头自动贩卖机里的那个摇头娃娃吗？

261
00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:52.240
Yeah.
记得。

262
00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:53.140
In the cold open?
在开场戏里？

263
00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:53.480
Yeah.
对。

264
00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:54.820
We talked about it.
我们讨论过那个。

265
00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:55.440
Okay.
好吧。

266
00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:59.300
Because is this when they put all of Dwight's things in the vending machine?
因为那是他们把德怀特的所有东西都放进自动贩卖机的时候吗？

267
00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:00.140
