Well, Jake Lauer and Penguin's Lovely wrote in to say, the bobblehead in the vending machine
嗯，杰克·劳尔和企鹅的可爱粉丝写信来说，自动贩卖机里的那个摇头娃娃

275
00:12:13.140 --> 00:12:16.300
is a baseball player named Mike Lieberthal.
是一个叫迈克·利伯塔尔的棒球运动员。

276
00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:17.580
