她有说是布伦达吗？

1800
01:09:19.820 --> 01:09:22.300
She goes, yeah, Jim, call for you.
她说的是：“没错，吉姆，有你的电话。”

1801
01:09:22.420 --> 01:09:22.800
It's Brenda.
是布伦达。

1802
01:09:24.400 --> 01:09:24.860
Yeah.
没错。

1803
01:09:24.860 --> 01:09:25.060
Wow.
哇。

1804
01:09:25.300 --> 01:09:29.440
And then it cuts to him by himself in the hallway by the Dunder Mifflin sign.
然后镜头切到他一个人站在邓德·米夫林标志旁的走廊里。

1805
01:09:29.440 --> 01:09:34.780
And he holds up a little piece of paper he's written on, and it says, she'll call back.
他举起一张写了字的小纸条，上面写着：她会回电的。

1806
01:09:37.200 --> 01:09:38.460
Oh, someone's confident.
噢，真是自信满满啊。

1807
01:09:39.120 --> 01:09:41.260
Also, there's a talking head that I have.
另外，我还有一个采访镜头。

1808
01:09:41.320 --> 01:09:42.740
It's also in the bloopers.
也在花絮里。

1809
01:09:43.200 --> 01:09:45.480
And Jen Salata and I could not get through this.
我和简·萨拉塔当时怎么也拍不下去。

1810
01:09:45.580 --> 01:09:46.180
We kept laughing.
我们一直在笑。

1811
01:09:46.180 --> 01:09:48.340
It's probably one of the reasons why they didn't use it.
这大概就是他们没用这段的原因吧。

1812
01:09:48.480 --> 01:09:52.240
But I have a line where I say, I used to get a runner's high.
但我有句台词是说，我以前跑步时会产生快感。

1813
01:09:52.460 --> 01:09:53.800
That's why now I swim.
所以我现在才改游泳了。

1814
01:09:54.120 --> 01:09:55.120
I remember that.
我记得那段。

1815
01:09:55.320 --> 01:09:57.440
And Jen could not stop laughing.
简当时笑得停不下来。

1816
01:09:57.440 --> 01:09:59.420
So in the bloopers, you hear her cracking up.
所以在花絮里，你能听到她笑场的声音。

1817
01:09:59.540 --> 01:10:02.540
I feel like Jen was particularly tickled by Angela, by the way.
顺便说一句，我觉得简特别喜欢安吉拉。

1818
01:10:02.940 --> 01:10:07.800
I feel like whenever you guys, whenever you had to do a talking head from a Jen Salata
我觉得每当你们，每当你要拍简·萨拉塔执导的

1819
01:10:07.800 --> 01:10:12.200
episode, everyone was like, all right, this is going to be a while because these two gals
剧集里的采访镜头时，大家都会想，好吧，这下要耗上一阵子了，因为这两个姑娘

1820
01:10:12.200 --> 01:10:13.320
are just going to crack up.
肯定会笑场。

1821
01:10:13.460 --> 01:10:15.700
Well, my lines were always so ridiculous.
嗯，我的台词总是那么荒唐。

1822
01:10:15.940 --> 01:10:17.760
Like, the stuff she would write for me would be so.
她写给我的那些东西简直……

1823
01:10:17.760 --> 01:10:18.300
That's what I mean.
我就是这个意思。

1824
01:10:18.300 --> 01:10:19.660
I think she liked your character.
我觉得她很喜欢你的角色。

1825
01:10:19.900 --> 01:10:20.900
And the same with Dwight.
德怀特也是一样。

1826
01:10:21.040 --> 01:10:25.560
She loved Dwight, too, because there's a deleted scene that's also in the bloopers where Dwight
她也很喜欢德怀特，因为有个删减片段也在花絮里，德怀特

1827
01:10:25.560 --> 01:10:29.740
has this talking head saying, I will find the person who committed this heinous crime
有个采访镜头说，我一定会找出那个犯下这起滔天罪行的人，

1828
01:10:29.740 --> 01:10:32.540
if I have to pray to Thor himself.
哪怕我必须向雷神本人祈祷。

1829
01:10:32.760 --> 01:10:34.460
He has this ridiculous talking head.
他那个采访镜头太荒唐了。

1830
01:10:34.860 --> 01:10:36.160
Rain could not get through it.
雷恩当时怎么也拍不下去。

1831
01:10:36.240 --> 01:10:37.980
Rain and Jen, they were dying.
雷恩和简，他们当时快笑死了。

1832
01:10:38.380 --> 01:10:40.500
And then lastly, in the deleted scenes.
最后，在删减片段里。

1833
01:10:40.580 --> 01:10:42.760
Is this when we find out whose joint it was?
我们是在那儿发现那根大麻是谁的吗？

1834
01:10:42.760 --> 01:10:43.060
Yes.
是的。

1835
01:10:43.060 --> 01:10:44.720
We have to tell everyone this.
我们得告诉大家这件事。

1836
01:10:44.840 --> 01:10:45.180
Of course.
当然。

1837
01:10:45.200 --> 01:10:45.840
You tell.
你说。

1838
01:10:46.000 --> 01:10:46.700
No, you tell.
不，你说。

1839
01:10:46.840 --> 01:10:47.500
You watched it.
是你看了那段。

1840
01:10:47.620 --> 01:10:47.940
Okay.
好吧。

1841
01:10:47.940 --> 01:10:55.300
Well, walking into the parking lot, the documentary camera crew catches the two guys from Vance
嗯，当他们走进停车场时，纪录片摄制组拍到了万斯制冷公司的两个人，

1842
01:10:55.300 --> 01:10:58.080
Refrigeration, played by our writers, Lee and Jean.
由我们的编剧李和吉恩饰演。

1843
01:10:58.320 --> 01:11:00.440
Gino and Leo are their character names.
他们角色的名字叫吉诺和里奥。

1844
01:11:00.760 --> 01:11:01.580
They're walking in.
他们正走进来。

1845
01:11:01.640 --> 01:11:03.420
It's just a spy shot from the back.
那只是个从背后偷拍的镜头。

1846
01:11:03.920 --> 01:11:07.000
And I think it's Jean is smoking a joint.
我想是吉恩在抽大麻。

1847
01:11:07.060 --> 01:11:09.060
And he just flicks it into the parking lot.
他随手把它弹到了停车场里。

1848
01:11:09.220 --> 01:11:10.400
That's whose joint it was.
那根大麻就是他的。

1849
01:11:10.400 --> 01:11:10.700
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1850
01:11:10.860 --> 01:11:12.100
Vance Refrigeration.
万斯制冷公司。

1851
01:11:12.240 --> 01:11:12.400
Yeah.
是啊。

1852
01:11:12.640 --> 01:11:14.000
No one at Dunder Mifflin.
邓德·米夫林公司没人。

1853
01:11:14.380 --> 01:11:15.080
There you go.
这就对了。

1854
01:11:15.240 --> 01:11:15.820
There you go.
这就对了。

1855
01:11:15.820 --> 01:11:17.460
That's drug testing, everyone.
各位，这就是药物测试。

1856
01:11:18.180 --> 01:11:21.180
Join us next week for Conflict Resolution.
下周请继续收听我们的《冲突解决》。

1857
01:11:21.440 --> 01:11:21.820
Yeah.
是啊。

1858
01:11:22.400 --> 01:11:22.860
All right.
好的。

1859
01:11:23.060 --> 01:11:25.040
I will see you guys next week.
下周见。

1860
01:11:25.440 --> 01:11:27.580
Jenna's going to let you know if I pass my urine teSt.
如果我通过了尿检，珍娜会告诉你们的。

1861
01:11:27.780 --> 01:11:28.400
I will.
我会的。

1862
01:11:28.640 --> 01:11:29.720
I'll let you know.
我会通知你们的。

1863
